DEVICE SPIKE

# A deliberately wrong attempt: it turns the moment the sensor sees the
# door's first edge. The rover is then not in front of the door, and its
# side scrapes the door frame.
WHEN flag clicked:
  set movement motors A B
  set movement speed 30
  start moving steering 0
  wait until spike distance D > 25
  stop movement
  set movement speed 15
  reset yaw
  start moving steering -100
  wait until spike angle yaw < -87
  stop movement
  set movement speed 30
  move forward 40 cm
